# Proof packs in detail (docs/guide/how-proof-packs.md).
title: CI turns mapped tests and floor runs into a hashed pack that ship verifies before it merges
direction: down
ready: Ready snapshot: criteria and their hash
map: Evidence map: .aayudha/evidence/N.toml
verify: verify in the merge gate runs the tests and floors
pack: pack.json: criteria, artifacts, checks
ledger: ledger branch: proof/story/sha/kind/
media: Media: LFS, a private bucket, or hash only
ship: ship runs proof verify, then merges
ready -> verify: criteria
map -> verify: tests per criterion
verify -> pack
pack -> ledger: data artifacts
pack -> media: screenshots
ledger -> ship: authoritative only
